=== Notable players ===

* '''[[Yuto Mifà]]''' — Balboan striker, all-time top scorer for the [[Balboa national football team|Balboa national team]] (62 goals), joined Prima's youth academy at 14, broke into the first team at 20, won the Abyalan Champions' Cup in 2021
* '''Makèna Diouf''' — Balboan midfielder, captain of the Balboa national team, known for his leadership and tactical intelligence
* '''Lin Sanclimenti''' — Balboan midfielder, product of Prima's youth system, emerging talent
* '''Kofi Mensah''' — Asikyiran forward, Prima's all-time top scorer with 187 goals in all competitions (2001–2016)
* '''Aminata Ndiaye''' — Asikyiran midfielder, Simb-era icon, 312 appearances for Prima (1970–1984)
* '''Ousmane Gueye''' — Asikyiran defender, captain during the 2012 Champions' Cup triumph

